node 3: synced count=5000 sum=12502500 last_committed=4 files_seqno=4 repl=0
2
––– comment –––
Rows without "cluster" are refused with the text of an ordinary /bulk insert (E21): the ordinary insert, a private bulk_import and a Shared one; nothing changes
––– input –––
printf '{"insert":{"table":"t","id":9001,"doc":{"title":"x","v":0}}}\n' > /tmp/n.ndjson; post 1308 '' /tmp/n.ndjson | sed 's/^/import: /'; curl -sS -X POST "http://127.0.0.1:1308/bulk" -H 'Content-Type: application/x-ndjson' --data-binary @/tmp/n.ndjson -w ' HTTP %{http_code}\n' | sed 's/^/plain: /'; post 2308 '&shared' /tmp/n.ndjson | sed 's/^/shared: /'; post 2308 '&shared' /tmp/commit.ndjson | sed 's/^/shared commit: /'; source /tmp/bc.sh; for n in 1 2 3; do echo "node $n count=$(m $n 'SELECT COUNT(*) FROM t')"; done
